LOOP

COMMENT
Date: 2026-09-23
Title: Test on/off DDS with DIGITAL channel 3 as trigger
Notes:
- EOM freq has code 48
- EOM amp has code 49
- 20 us pulse at 10 MHz

ENDCOMMENT

INIT
Trigger EOM = Off                                                      (3)
EOM Amp = [0]                                                          (49)
EOM Freq = 10.0 MHz                                                    (48)
ENDINIT

INNER
+2s             EOM Amp = [0]                                                (49)
+1ms            Trigger = On                                                 (3)
+1us            EOM Amp = [20]                                               (49)
+20us           EOM Amp = [0]                                                (49)
+1ms            Trigger = Off                                                (3)
ENDINNER

ITERATIONS 5

ENDLOOP
